00:22:30.480 --> 00:22:33.420
Hair and makeup and wardrobe was in room 239.
发型、化妆和服装组在239号房间。

516
00:22:33.840 --> 00:22:35.900
There was also a cast green room.
还有一个演员休息室。

517
00:22:35.900 --> 00:22:40.220
All of the cast trailers were out in the parking lot.
所有的演员拖车都停在停车场里。

