Also, your mama don't dance, and your daddy don't rock and roll.
还有《你妈不跳舞，你爸不摇滚》。

599
00:26:16.740 --> 00:26:17.960
That's Loggins and Messina.
那也是洛金斯与梅西纳的歌。

