I did not look up the weather.
我没查过天气。

1220
00:55:51.160 --> 00:55:56.080
Well, there was the person who wrote in the other week about how, like, it has nice weather.
嗯，前几周有人写信来说那里的天气很好。

1221
00:55:56.420 --> 00:55:56.940
Oh, yeah.
哦，对。

1222
00:55:57.120 --> 00:55:58.060
Should we go there?
我们要去那里吗？

1223
00:55:58.640 --> 00:55:59.520
I mean—
我是说——

1224
00:55:59.520 --> 00:56:04.100
I'm really interested after all of these facts you've told me today.
听了你今天说的这些事实，我真的很感兴趣。

1225
00:56:04.360 --> 00:56:06.420
